# The Oracle NPC's Claude integration (webadmin/oracle.py). Add the keys
# you want to /etc/toc/web.env (the dashboard's EnvironmentFile), then
# restart toc-web. It stays DORMANT -- no API calls, no cost -- until
# ORACLE_ENABLED=1 and a key is present; without them the Oracle just
# says nothing in-game.
#
# One-time host setup when enabling: install the SDK into the dashboard
# venv -- /srv/toc/venv/bin/pip install anthropic

# Turn it on (both required):
# ORACLE_API_KEY=sk-ant-...      # an Anthropic API key (or reuse ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
# ORACLE_ENABLED=1               # default 0

# Optional, defaults shown:
# ORACLE_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5  # haiku is cheapest; also sonnet-5-5 / opus-5-5
# ORACLE_DAILY_USD=1.0           # hard daily spend ceiling; past it it goes quiet
# ORACLE_PER_PLAYER_HOUR=10      # per-player question cap per hour
# ORACLE_MAX_ANSWER_TOKENS=220   # answer length cap
# ORACLE_STATE=/var/lib/toc/oracle.state.json
